{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Larchie 是一款協助家長整理學校群組、繳費提醒、預約與各類通知的 App，適合不想終日埋首手機、又怕漏掉重要家庭事務的使用者。它會讀取家長群組對話，將容易忽略的訊息、表格期限與待付款項整合成每日簡短簡報。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-27.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>每日簡報集中重要事項</h2>\n\n\n<p>Larchie 每日提供簡報，只列出當天真正需要處理的事情；語音訊息會轉為重點，讓家長不必反覆重聽。分散的訊息與提醒會化成清晰待辦清單，並與現有行事曆保持同步。學校群組的重要更新會優先顯示，閒聊與感謝回覆自動退後；使用者也可自然提問，讓 Larchie 記住家庭日程與對話，減少重複說明。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-57-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-62-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Larchie</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/larchie/id6789521349?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.422381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:36:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"d1a168ce2fcdf39d93f4790076066cc1c4c45f9086f1a1f7c2ea8037134b8757","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}